    <string name="water_statistics_help_title">About the statistics</string>
    <string name="water_statistics_help_line1">• The chart shows your daily intake: green bars indicate you reached or exceeded your goal, red bars mean you didn\'t.</string>
    <string name="water_statistics_help_line2">• In the history, the liters consumed appear in green if you met your goal that day, or red if not.</string>
    <string name="water_statistics_help_line3">• The weekly average is based on your last 7 recorded days.</string>
    <string name="water_statistics_help_line4">• All data is stored locally on your device.</string>
    <string name="water_statistics_help_line5">• Tap any day in the history to edit the recorded water intake.</string>

